{"id":"sencillo","lemma":"sencillo","pos":"adj","rank":1627,"glosses":["plain","simple, straightforward"],"ipa":"/senˈθiʝo/","forms":{"feminine":"sencilla","masculinePlural":"sencillos","femininePlural":"sencillas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sencillo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mira, mucho más sencillo.","en":"Try something simpler.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850216"},{"text":"Yo llevo una vida sencilla.","en":"I live a simple life.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454369"},{"text":"Muchos errores se podrían evitar con experimentos sencillos.","en":"Many mistakes could've been avoided through simple experiments.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692715"},{"text":"Vamos a comenzar por las preguntas sencillas.","en":"Let's start with the easy questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645694"},{"text":"Encontrar su oficina fue sencillo.","en":"Finding his office was easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611592"}]}